      <h2 class="h4">  Student Housing and Residential Life
</h2>
      <p class="widget__subheading">  Student Housing Office
</p>
    <hr>
        <p>17950 Lassen St.<br>
Northridge, CA 91325<br>
<a href="mailto:housing@csun.edu" title="Housing email address">housing@csun.edu</a></p>

    <p>
          <strong>Phone:</strong>  (818) 677-2160

              <br> <strong>Fax:</strong>  (818) 677-4888

      </p>
      <p><strong>Office Hours</strong><br>
Monday-Friday: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m.<br>
Saturday and Sunday:&nbsp;Closed</p>



